  "notes": "Adds Fic Text Box and Fic Info Box as full Gradient Studio targets. Both support the existing linear, radial, conic, multi-stop, per-stop opacity, metallic/pasted CSS gradient workflow. Each box has an Edit Gradient shortcut, box opacity is multiplied into the gradient background while text/content stays fully opaque, and the final AO3 CSS export includes the selected box gradients."
